OL,3,GNEWSAM8 Eastbound closed after man
OL,4,Afalls from bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major motorway in Glasgow is closed
OL,7,Fafter a man fell to his death from a
OL,8,Fbridge.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the incident
OL,11,Fhappened just before 03:00 on Sunday
OL,12,Fmorning at the M8 Junction 11, near the
OL,13,FCranhill area of the city.
OL,15,FThe eastbound carriageway remained
OL,16,Fclosed on Sunday morning as
OL,17,Finvestigations into the 29-year-old's
OL,18,Fdeath continued.
OL,20,FA diversion route is in place, taking
OL,21,Fthe traffic off from Junction 11 and
OL,22,Frejoining at Junction 10.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
